  "description": "Enhance your 2015-2026 Ford F-150 SuperCrew Cab or 2017-2026 F-250/F-350 Crew Cab with OEDRO Heavy-Duty Running Boards. Built with a 6.8\" polygonal steel tube, 3.5\" drop step, and dual-raised design, these side steps deliver convenient cab and bed access, anti-slip traction, strong support, and durable protection for work, travel, and off-road adventures.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for your Trucks: Designed specifically for truck models, OEDRO running boards provide a seamless fit while enhancing truck accessibility and rugged styling.\nDual-Raised 4-Zone Step Design for Better Access: The innovative dual-level layout creates four functional stepping zones, including wide lower steps for safe entry and elevated access points for reaching roof racks, truck beds, and cargo areas with ease.\n6.8\" Wide Polygonal Steel Tube with 3.5\" Drop Step: Built with a rugged 6.8-inch wide angular steel tube and 3.5-inch drop step design, these nerf bars provide a bold off-road appearance while balancing ground clearance and protection from rocks and debris.\nTriangular Reinforced Structure Supports 550 lbs: Featuring a rhombus tube design and specialized three-tube triangular welding structure, these side steps improve load distribution, stability, and durability, supporting up to 550 lbs per side without flexing.\nBolt-On Installation & Durable Anti-Slip Surface: Direct bolt-on installation requires no drilling or vehicle modification. The textured step surface provides reliable traction, while the corrosion-resistant finish helps withstand harsh weather and daily driving conditions.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2026 Ford F150 Supercrew Cab\nCompatible with 2017-2026 Ford F250 F350 Super Duty Cab",
  "highlights": [
    "Constructed from heavy-duty carbon steel with a reinforced polygonal tube structure, these running boards are built to withstand extreme conditions and daily heavy use. The corrosion-resistant black powder-coated finish helps protect against rust, scratches, and road debris, ensuring long-term durability and a rugged off-road appearance that lasts.",
    "Designed for hassle-free installation, these running boards feature a direct bolt-on system that requires no drilling or complex modifications. Precision-engineered mounting brackets ensure a secure and stable fit, allowing you to complete the installation with basic tools in a short amount of time.",
    "The smart dual-raised step system provides multiple stepping points, making it easier and safer for passengers of all ages to enter and exit the vehicle. The wide lower step offers stable footing, while the elevated step improves access to roof racks or truck bed cargo, reducing strain during loading and unloading."
  ],
